sequenceDiagram
      actor User
      participant BahmniWeb as Bahmni Web
      participant Reports as Reports Service
      participant OMRS_DB as OpenMRS DB
      participant ELIS_DB as OpenELIS DB
      participant Odoo_DB as Odoo DB

      User->>BahmniWeb: Open Reports module
      BahmniWeb->>Reports: GET report request
      Reports->>OMRS_DB: SQL — clinical data
      Reports->>ELIS_DB: SQL — lab data
      Reports->>Odoo_DB: SQL — billing data
      Reports-->>User: Compiled report